#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84_Tanimura"
msgid "Excuse me. Did you happen to see some men leading a woman\\r\naway against her will?"
msgstr "Disculpe. ¿Vio usted si unos hombres se llevaron a una mujer a\\r\nla fuerza, como si la estuvieran secuestrando?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "96_Businesswoman"
msgid "Yes! As a matter of fact, I did! They took her away\\r\nin a car!"
msgstr "¡Sí, sí los vi! ¡Se la llevaron en un auto a toda\\r\nvelocidad!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108_Tanimura"
msgid "Did they say anything about where they were headed?"
msgstr "¿Dijeron algo sobre a dónde iban?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "120_Businesswoman"
msgid "Well... I was so shocked and it all happened so fast...\\r\nBut... I did hear them shouting something."
msgstr "Pues... Me agarró tan de sorpresa y todo pasó tan rápido...\\r\nPero... sí escuché que gritaban algo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "132_Tanimura"
msgid "Do you remember what it was they were they shouting?\\r\nAny bit of information would really help me out."
msgstr "¿Recuerda qué era lo que gritaban? Cualquier detalle me\\r\nayudaría un montón."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "144_Businesswoman"
msgid "Right, of course. Let me think... Oh yeah, I remember\\r\nit was something about the ocean!"
msgstr "Ah, sí, claro. Déjame pensar... Ah, sí, ya me acuerdo,\\r\n¡Era algo sobre el océano!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "156_Businesswoman"
msgid "Yes, it was definitely something about the\\r\nocean, like a place down on the coast."
msgstr "Sí, sin duda era algo relacionado con el océano,\\r\ncomo un lugar allá en la costa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "168_Tanimura"
msgid "I see. Thanks for your help."
msgstr "Entendido, Muchas gracias."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "180_Tanimura"
msgid "(The ocean... So they really must've gone down to the docks.)"
msgstr "(El océano... Así que seguro que fueron a los muelles)."
